Output pipelines.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1500
Set Height 860
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 15ms
Env TERM xterm-256color
Env COLORTERM truecolor
Env CODEX_HOME "/tmp/om-ctx-home"
Hide
Type "cd /tmp/om-ctx-ws && clear && ~/Documents/projects/Overmind/codex-rs/target/debug/codex -m composer-2.5"
Enter
Sleep 12s
Show
Type "/pipeline list"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Screenshot overmind-pipeline-list.png
Type "/pipeline inspect high-end-whiteboard"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Screenshot overmind-pipeline-inspect.png
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 2s
